{"id":"80c8596c-e8f6-4547-a28a-c44347cdbfc5","rule_id":"8f8004e1-0783-485f-a3da-aca4362f74a7","name":"【默认】Linux用户或用户组删除","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":3,"revision":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-16T01:46:31.657Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-07T03:13:30.958Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-9m","to":"now","description":" 对应 Linux 身份审计。","tags":["主题: 身份安全","操作系统: Linux","来源: 默认"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Stealth","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1070","name":"Indicator Removal","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1070/"}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0040","name":"Impact","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0040/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1531","name":"Account Access Removal","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1531/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","host.id","user.name","user.id","source.ip","source.port","event.action","event.outcome","event.category","message","event.original","related.user","related.ip","agent.id"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.outcome","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"event.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n发现用户或组被删除。\n\n### 为何重要\n可能是掩盖痕迹或破坏可用性。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 确认被删对象。\n2. 是否与攻击清理行为时间吻合。\n3. 核对工单。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["离职清理流程中的标准删除"],"references":[],"risk_score":21,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"low","severity_mapping":[],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","timestamp_override_fallback_disabled":false,"output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"meta":{"kibana_siem_app_url":""},"type":"eql","language":"eql","index":["filebeat-*","logs-system.auth-*"],"query":"iam where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type in (\"group\", \"user\") and event.type == \"deletion\" and event.outcome == \"success\"\n","filters":[]}
